    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"decide what happens next\"... that's exactly it. i feel like i'm just holding onto this life out of habit or fear of what happens if i stop, but it doesn't feel right. like i'm just waiting for an opening to fix the mistake. if everything was truly balanced, wouldn't it be better if the debt was actually settled?",
